post-it: Blue screen of death
symptoms:
	Blue screen
		shows: 2 s after the desktop appears, a bluescreen says "A fatal exception 0E has occurred", in silence
	Restarts by itself
		shows: a moment after the desktop appears, the computer stops answering and reboots, again after every start
checks:
	Windows stays up after the desktop appears
		shows: it shows a bluescreen 2 s after the desktop appears and reboots 6 s later
	Runs without a bluescreen
		shows: "A fatal exception 0E has occurred at 0028:C0002B6F in VXD IOS(01)"
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Take out the hard drive, throw it in the trash
	Get a new hard drive from storage
	Install the hard drive
	Remount the shell
